      "q": "What does Bae Systems Technology Solutions and Services sell to the government?",
      "a": "Bae Systems Technology Solutions and Services sells Engineering Services and related IT and manufacturing work to the government. Engineering Services accounts for $514M in obligations and Computer Systems Design Services accounts for $87.8M, with Other Computer Related Services at $29M and Search, Detection, Navigation, Guidance, Aeronautical, and Nautical System and Instrument Manufacturing at $30.1M."
